<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Eagler Launcher (all-in-one)</title>
<meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
<style>
:root{--bg:#0e1015;--card:#171a22;--line:#262b38;--fg:#e6e9f0;--dim:#8b93a7;--acc:#4ade80;--acc2:#22c55e;--warn:#fbbf24}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{margin:0;height:100%;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font:15px/1.45 system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif}
body.playing #menu{display:none}
header{padding:28px 20px 8px;max-width:980px;margin:auto}
h1{margin:0;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:.3px}
header p{margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--dim)}
.opts{max-width:980px;margin:14px auto 0;padding:0 20px}
.lm{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px}
.lm label{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}
.lm .sub{color:var(--dim);font-size:13px;margin:6px 0 0 28px;display:none}
.lm.on .sub{display:block}
.lm.on{border-color:var(--warn)}
.lm .warn{color:var(--warn)}
.lm select{background:#0e1015;color:var(--fg);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:2px 6px}
main{max-width:980px;margin:14px auto 20px;padding:0 20px;display:grid;gap:12px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(290px,1fr))}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.card h2{margin:0;font-size:19px}
.ver{color:var(--acc);font-size:13px;font-weight:600}
.meta{color:var(--dim);font-size:12.5px;min-height:34px}
.card select{width:100%;background:#0e1015;color:var(--fg);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:7px}
button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer}
.go{margin-top:auto;background:var(--acc2);color:#04130a;border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:10px;font-weight:700}
.go:hover{background:var(--acc)}
body.busy .go{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}
footer{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto 30px;padding:0 20px;color:var(--dim);font-size:12.5px}
footer p{margin:4px 0}
#stage{position:fixed;inset:0;background:#000;display:none;overflow:hidden}
body.playing #stage{display:block}
#stage iframe{border:0;background:#000;display:block;transform-origin:0 0}
#bar{position:fixed;top:0;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:5;opacity:.25;transition:opacity .15s;display:none}
body.playing #bar{display:block}
#bar:hover,#bar:focus-within{opacity:1}
#back{background:#1f2430;color:var(--fg);border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:0;border-radius:0 0 10px 10px;padding:5px 16px;font-size:13px}
#back:hover{background:#2b3140}
#msg{color:var(--warn);padding:0 20px;max-width:980px;margin:8px auto 0;min-height:1px;font-size:13px}
#msg button{margin-left:10px;background:#1f2430;color:var(--fg);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:2px 10px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="menu">
  <header>
    <h1>Eagler Launcher</h1>
    <p>All clients are stored inside this one file. A client is only unpacked when you press Launch, one at a time.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="opts">
    <div class="lm" id="lmbox">
      <label><input type="checkbox" id="lm"> Low memory mode</label>
      <div class="sub">
        <span class="warn">Warning:</span> prefers the lightest build of each client, renders the game at a reduced resolution
        (<select id="scale"><option value="0.75">75%</option><option value="0.67" selected>67%</option><option value="0.5">50%</option></select>)
        and caps FPS at <select id="fps"><option value="30" selected>30</option><option value="45">45</option><option value="20">20</option></select>.
        Picture is blurrier and less smooth. Please also lower render distance (2-6 chunks) and turn Fancy graphics off in the game's own Video Settings: the launcher cannot change those for you.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="msg"></div>
  <main id="list"></main>
  <footer>
    <p id="envnote"></p>
    <p id="trim"></p>
    <p>Worlds/settings are stored by your browser for this page's address, so keep opening this file from the same place.</p>
  </footer>
</div>
<div id="stage"></div>
<div id="bar"><button id="back" title="Close the game and return to the launcher">&larr; Back to launcher (close game)</button></div>
